; name: Lettering round a column
; group: Rotary axis
; description: Text v-carved round a Ø60 × 300 mm round blank on the rotary axis (along Y, Z0 on the axis) with a 90° V-bit: drawn flat on the unrolled surface, wrapped round the blank. Change the text, font and size; the dashed outline shows the unrolled surface (once round is π × the diameter).
; 
